angerous players in the sport. Plus, we recap the Women&apos;s, Seniors, and Juniors divisions, highlighting championship performances from Charity Shirley, Jamie Guffey and Desirrae McCoy, Joanne Martin, Mike Miller, Bryce Macdonald, Carter Gonzales, and Keegan Leonard. Join us as we break down Open #13, catch up with one of the hottest players in cornhole, and look ahead to the next chapter of the ACL season." type="movie" contentRating="M/12" duration="3600000" originallyAvailableAt="2026-06-23T00:00:00Z" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/bbb/media_list/thumbnails/poster/2000x2858/around_the_acl_2by3.jpg" title="Around the ACL" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Around the ACL" type="coverArt" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/bbb/media_list/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/around_the_acl_16by9.jpg"/><Image alt="Around the ACL" type="coverPoster" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/bbb/media_list/thumbnails/poster/2000x2858/around_the_acl_2by3.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" id="620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" ratingKey="genre_620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" slug="sports" tag="Sports" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1782345600" duration="3600000" endsAt="1782349200" id="6a333d266fce8722eac5cae1" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/></Video><Video art="https://cdnapisec.kaltura.com/p/513551/sp/51355100/thumbnail/entry_id/1_pnt16wb7/version/0/vid_sec/2340/width/3840/height/2160/type/3/a.jpg" guid="plex://movie/6a333d256fce8722eac5cadd" key="/library/metadata/6a333d256fce8722eac5cadd" ratingKey="6a333d256fce8722eac5cadd" summary="Doubles Final Four from April 26, 2026" type="movie" contentRating="A" duration="9000000" originallyAvailableAt="2026-05-16T00:00:00Z" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://provider-static.plex.tv/epg/cms/production/1c897c1a-e779-4746-8845-c8625b2d91c0/Ple